    <string name="qr_pair_title">Connect a phone</string>
    <string name="qr_instructions">Open Google Authenticator, Microsoft Authenticator, Aegis, or another authenticator app on your phone and scan the QR code. The same active QR can be added to several parents’ phones. It is unique to this installation and never leaves your devices.</string>
    <string name="qr_content_description">QR code for connecting an authenticator app</string>
    <string name="qr_code_notice">A phone code works for up to 5 minutes, so it is easy to enter with a remote. A new code appears every 30 seconds, and old codes are never stored in a list.</string>
