    <string name="accessibility_consent">I understand the purpose of the service and allow it to identify the active app in order to apply the time limit</string>
    <string name="usb_recovery_setup_notice">Emergency reset: connecting a USB flash drive clears the PIN and disables protection. Some devices do not forward events from USB keyboards or receivers to the app.</string>
